         <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;The user-defined &amp;quot;executable&amp;quot; script which performs the calculations for objective.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(1) This entry should include an &amp;quot;absolute&amp;quot; path to avoid issues in locating the script.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(2) This field is mandatory for all objectives.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(3) For a remote job the script should be on the remote cluster, while for a local run it should be in a local path.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(4) This field should not contain any white space character in between.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
        </property>
        <property name="placeholderText">
